OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAn unsettled morning with rain
OL,6,Fand strong winds. An improving picture
OL,7,Fhowever, turning drier and brighter
OL,8,Fduring the afternoon with winds
OL,9,Feasing. Feeling less cold than of late
OL,10,Ftoo. Maximum Temperature 11C.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly dry end to the day
OL,13,Fand fine evening, but heavy, blustery
OL,14,Fshowers returning by Sunday morning.
OL,15,FFeeling fresh overnight but not as
OL,16,Fcold as recent nights. Minimum
OL,17,FTemperature 6C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
