OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA windy day ahead with coastal
OL,6,Fgales possible. A band of rain moving
OL,7,Feastwards in the morning, with
OL,8,Fsunshine and showers following.
OL,9,FFeeling fresh in the wind. Maximum
OL,10,FTemperature 11C.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,13,Fshowery day on Monday, and feeling
OL,14,Fchilly in blustery winds. Becoming
OL,15,Fdrier, brighter and less windy on
OL,16,FTuesday. Some rain arriving midweek,
OL,17,Fand turning windy again, though milder
OL,18,Ftoo.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
